    "ashwagandha_pack_reviews_mTCEB8": {
      "type": "ashwagandha-pack-reviews",
      "blocks": {
        "content_hhWweC": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "the_text": "<p><em>“I started taking this Moringa powder to support my immune system, and </em><em><strong>I swear I’ve made it through two cold seasons without even a sniffle</strong></em><em>. It’s packed with nutrients and doesn’t upset my stomach like some other supplements have.</em><em><strong> I love that it's just pure Moringa leaves.</strong></em><em>”</em></p><p><strong>-Martha Cookson</strong></p>"
          }
        },
        "content_Kpg8TW": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "the_text": "<p><em>“This powder has become a staple in my daily routine. I was looking for something plant-based to help support my energy naturally, and this did the trick. </em><em><strong>I don’t get that afternoon slump anymore, and I feel a lot more alert during my workouts too. </strong></em><em>Plus, it's nice knowing it's non-GMO and vegan!”</em></p><p>- <strong>Sierra F</strong></p>"
          }
        },
        "content_UerEJb": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "the_text": "<p><em>“</em><em><strong>My digestion has improved a lot since I started using this Moringa powder.</strong></em><em> I add it to a little warm water with lemon before breakfast and it really seems to help things move. Also, it’s organic and clean, which is super important to me.”</em></p><p>-<strong> Jaida S</strong></p>"
          }
        },
        "content_CmXnwU": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "the_text": "<p><em>“I wasn't sure what to expect when I tried Moringa, but this brand is amazing. I feel less bloated, more energized, and even my skin seems to have a little more glow. I’ve recommended it to my friends and family. </em><em><strong>Love that it’s just one ingredient—pure and simple.</strong></em><em>”</em></p><p>- <strong>Drew Gidding</strong></p>"
          }
        },
        "content_6kjEM3": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "the_text": "<p><em>“I’m really impressed with the quality of this Moringa powder. I’ve used others before, but </em><em><strong>this one just feels fresher and more potent.</strong></em><em> I’ve been mixing it into my smoothies and protein shakes and it blends well.”</em></p><p>-<strong> Billy S</strong></p>"
          }
        },
        "content_kaXD8X": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "the_text": "<p><em>“I originally bought this for energy support, and now I take it daily. </em><em><strong>It’s a nice, clean boost</strong></em><em>—not like caffeine, just a general feeling of wellness and stamina. I’ve even noticed less joint stiffness lately. </em><em><strong>It’s amazing what a single plant can do.</strong></em><em>”</em></p><p><strong>- Rene F</strong></p>"
          }
        },
        "content_bH9VFY": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "the_text": "<p><em>“I’m always on the hunt for natural ways to support my skin, and Moringa has been a game-changer.</em><em><strong> My complexion looks clearer, and my skin feels more hydrated.</strong></em><em> I add a scoop to my matcha in the mornings—it’s earthy but actually kind of nice once you get used to it.”</em> </p><p>- <strong>Jennifer Burns</strong></p>"
          }
        },
        "content_eT8MXC": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "the_text": "<p><em>“What I love most about this powder is how gentle it is. I take it on an empty stomach sometimes and never have any issues. It’s become part of my morning routine, and </em><em><strong>I’ve definitely noticed more consistency in my energy and focus throughout the day.</strong></em><em>”</em></p><p>- <strong>Lacey P</strong></p>"
          }
        },
        "content_AMjLp9": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "the_text": "<p><em>“I’ve tried a few different Moringa powders, and this is by far the best. It smells fresh, tastes clean, and </em><em><strong>gives me that ‘I’m doing something good for myself’ feeling.</strong></em><em> I use it mainly for overall wellness, and so far, I’ve had great results—more energy, fewer sugar cravings, and a better mood.”</em></p><p><em>-</em><strong> Madison Cross</strong></p>"
          }
        },
        "content_dEaCMm": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "the_text": "<p><em>“This is my third bag and I’m still loving it. I was dealing with some mild inflammation and joint pain, and Moringa seems to help. I combine it with turmeric sometimes for an extra anti-inflammatory boost. </em><em><strong>It’s amazing how effective natural products can be when they’re this pure.”</strong></em></p><p><strong>- Sandra Wright</strong><br/><br/></p>"
          }
        },
        "content_V3FiVp": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
