    "ashwagandha_pack_custom_text_gPWqhq": {
      "type": "ashwagandha-pack-custom-text",
      "blocks": {
        "content_x4cVzW": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "the_title": "Potency, from the very beginning",
            "the_text": "<p>While we believe nature is the best chemist, not all herbs are created equal. That’s why we take great care to source our Organic Moringa from dedicated organic farmers in Karnataka, Southwest India, who know what it takes to create and sustain an optimal growing environment that yields the purest, most potent (i.e., effective) moringa trees.</p>"
          }
        },
        "content_jx8Upn": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "the_title": "Dedicated to bioactive compounds preservation",
            "the_text": "<p>Unlike many other moringa powder products, our Organic Moringa boasts a bright, vibrant green hue instead of being a swampy green or downright brown. The secret to its lively color? It’s in the painstaking steps we take to maximize the preservation of nutrients and bioactive compounds. After hand-harvesting only the young leaves (leaving out the matured and yellow ones), the moringa is gently shade-dried in canopies, passed through a stem separator, and then undergoes a proprietary, temperature-controlled grinding process — resulting in Moringa powder that captures and concentrates the miracle tree’s incredible nutritional profile. </p>"
          }
        },
        "content_rgR9dX": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "the_title": "USDA-certified organic",
            "the_text": "<p>Organic Moringa is USDA-certified organic. Our moringa plants are clean and responsibly sourced from producers that align with our values of sustainable and organic farming practices. This means they use regenerative practices such as permaculture, crop rotation, composting, and the cessation of pesticide and herbicide use. In other words, you can rest assured that our Organic Moringa is good for your body and the environment. </p>"
          }
        },
        "content_7eCe3f": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "the_title": "Third-party tested",
            "the_text": "<p>Like all our products, Organic Moringa is rigorously lab and third-party-tested. This includes complete microbial testing for any bacteria, yeast, and mold; heavy metals testing; pesticide testing; and testing for purity and active compounds. But you shouldn’t just take our word for it. Because we believe in full transparency, we publish our lab results (i.e., Certificate of Analysis or CoA) on our website. <a href=\"/pages/impact-sustainability\" title=\"Impact & Sustainability\"><strong>Go ahead, check it out for yourself</strong>. </a></p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "content_x4cVzW",
